@host = http://localhost:5136

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Classify an image
POST {{host}}/api/ai?outputFormat=json
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=b

--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="model"

imageclassifier
--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="cat.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./samples/cat.jpg
--b--

### OCR
POST {{host}}/api/ai/ocr
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=b

--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="ocr-chi.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./samples/ocr-chi.png
--b--

### Ask the agent (needs Ollama)
POST {{host}}/api/ai/ask?outputFormat=text
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=b

--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="prompt"

What text is written in this image?
--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="ocr-eng.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./samples/ocr-eng.png
--b--
